{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>KID PILOT</i></strong> is a VR flying game where every level you unlock is unique and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484570/extras/KidPilot-OfficialLaunchTrailer_LatinAmericanGamesShowcase-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1740424716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>FLY &amp; SHOOT</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The gameplay is straight-forward. Move the plane with your hand and shoot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484570/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker.gif?t=1740424716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>COMPLETE CHALLENGES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress through the game, you will encounter harder challenges to put your pilot abilities to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484570/extras/KP_SteamGif_Dragordito01.gif?t=1740424716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>EPIC BOSS FIGHTS!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who doesn\u2019t love epic bosses?\u00a0<strong><i>KID PILOT</i></strong>\u00a0is no exception, so be ready to be challenged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484570/extras/KP_SteamGif_Magmanimus02.gif?t=1740424716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>UNIQUE LEVELS</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two levels are the same! Can you complete them all?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragra